{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2021-03-25 08:00:00', 'title': 'IBM POSITIONED AS A LEADER IN 2021 GARTNER MAGIC QUADRANT FOR INSIGHT ENGINES', 'text': 'ARMONK, N.Y., MARCH 25, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IBM (NYSE: IBM) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT GLOBAL RESEARCH FIRM GARTNER HAS POSITIONED IBM AS A LEADER IN THE NEWLY PUBLISHED 2021 GARTNER MAGIC QUADRANT FOR INSIGHT ENGINES 1.'}